Below are fully updated versions of both operators (Windows + Linux TMUX) with the missing “Control-M style reattach” semantics:

✅ Reattach after worker pod restart / retry (no duplicate remote session)
✅ Adopt result if remote job already finished (mark success/failed)
✅ Keep your cross-run serialization via dedup_key (queue behind another active job if needed)
✅ Add map_index into job_id to avoid collisions with mapped tasks

These updates are based on your current files 

